### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5090
# All business routes are under /api/v1. Dates must be in the future relative to the server clock.

### 1. Create room (201 + Location)
# @name createRoom
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Study room 1",
  "capacity": 10
}

###
@roomId = {{createRoom.response.body.$.id}}

### 2. Get room (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms/{{roomId}}

### 3. Get a missing room (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### 4. R1: name only spaces (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "   ", "capacity": 10 }

### 5. R1: capacity 0 (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Room X", "capacity": 0 }

### 6. Create booking (201, status Active)
# @name createBooking
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "ana",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-10T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-10T12:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 4
}

###
@bookingId = {{createBooking.response.body.$.id}}

### 7. Get booking (200, all fields)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bookings/{{bookingId}}

### 8. R7: partial overlap (409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bookedBy": "bogdan", "startUtc": "2030-01-10T11:00:00Z", "endUtc": "2030-01-10T13:00:00Z", "attendees": 4 }

### 9. R7: identical interval (409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bookedBy": "bogdan", "startUtc": "2030-01-10T10:00:00Z", "endUtc": "2030-01-10T12:00:00Z", "attendees": 4 }

### 10. R7: contained interval (409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bookedBy": "bogdan", "startUtc": "2030-01-10T10:30:00Z", "endUtc": "2030-01-10T11:30:00Z", "attendees": 4 }

### 11. R7: touching after (201) — starts exactly when #6 ends
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bookedBy": "carmen", "startUtc": "2030-01-10T12:00:00Z", "endUtc": "2030-01-10T13:00:00Z", "attendees": 4 }

### 12. R7: touching before (201) — ends exactly when #6 starts
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bookedBy": "dan", "startUtc": "2030-01-10T09:00:00Z", "endUtc": "2030-01-10T10:00:00Z", "attendees": 4 }

### 13. R2: bookedBy only spaces (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bookedBy": "  ", "startUtc": "2030-02-01T10:00:00Z", "endUtc": "2030-02-01T11:00:00Z", "attendees": 4 }

### 14. R3: end == start (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bookedBy": "ana", "startUtc": "2030-02-01T10:00:00Z", "endUtc": "2030-02-01T10:00:00Z", "attendees": 4 }

### 15. R4: attendees 0 (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bookedBy": "ana", "startUtc": "2030-02-01T10:00:00Z", "endUtc": "2030-02-01T11:00:00Z", "attendees": 0 }

### 16. R4: attendees over capacity (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bookedBy": "ana", "startUtc": "2030-02-01T10:00:00Z", "endUtc": "2030-02-01T11:00:00Z", "attendees": 11 }

### 17. R4: attendees == capacity (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bookedBy": "ana", "startUtc": "2030-02-02T10:00:00Z", "endUtc": "2030-02-02T11:00:00Z", "attendees": 10 }

### 18. R5: start in the past (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bookedBy": "ana", "startUtc": "2020-01-01T10:00:00Z", "endUtc": "2020-01-01T11:00:00Z", "attendees": 4 }

### 19. R6: exactly 4 hours (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bookedBy": "ana", "startUtc": "2030-02-03T08:00:00Z", "endUtc": "2030-02-03T12:00:00Z", "attendees": 4 }

### 20. R6: more than 4 hours (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bookedBy": "ana", "startUtc": "2030-02-04T08:00:00Z", "endUtc": "2030-02-04T12:00:01Z", "attendees": 4 }

### 21. Missing room + invalid data (404 before validation)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bookedBy": "", "startUtc": "2030-02-01T10:00:00Z", "endUtc": "2030-02-01T09:00:00Z", "attendees": 0 }

### 22. R8: cancel (204)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bookings/{{bookingId}}/cancel

### 23. R8: booking is now Cancelled
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bookings/{{bookingId}}

### 24. R8: cancel again (409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bookings/{{bookingId}}/cancel

### 25. R8: cancel missing booking (404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bookings/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/cancel

### 26. R8: the cancelled interval is free again (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bookedBy": "bogdan", "startUtc": "2030-01-10T10:00:00Z", "endUtc": "2030-01-10T12:00:00Z", "attendees": 4 }

### 27. Unversioned route must NOT work (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}

